{"title":"Career Roadmap · Translator","role":"Translator","summary":"A Translator converts written content from one language into another while preserving meaning, tone, terminology, cultural context, and intended purpose.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Translator converts written content from one language into another while preserving meaning, tone, terminology, cultural context, and intended purpose."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Linguistics is a strong academic foundation because it develops understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Phonetics and phonology"},{"text":"Morphology and syntax"},{"text":"Semantics and pragmatics"},{"text":"Sociolinguistics"},{"text":"Language variation and change"},{"text":"Translation theory"},{"text":"Discourse and communication"},{"text":"Language documentation and analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, linguistics alone does not make someone job-ready as a professional translator. The student should develop high proficiency in at least two working languages, domain knowledge, translation technology, terminology management, editing and proofreading skills."},{"type":"p","text":"For specialised translation—such as legal, medical, technical, financial or certified translation—additional domain training and, where applicable, certification/authorization requirements are important."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Foundation & Entry"},{"text":"BA Linguistics + advanced language proficiency + translation portfolio + internships"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Professional Translator"},{"text":"Translator, Localization Associate, Language Specialist, Translation Project Coordinator"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior/Specialist"},{"text":"Senior Translator, Localization Specialist, Terminologist, Translation QA Specialist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Leadership/Expert"},{"text":"Translation Lead, Language Manager, Localization Manager, Translation Consultant, Independent Specialist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BA Linguistics","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop five major capabilities:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Linguistic expertise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Syntax"},{"text":"Semantics"},{"text":"Pragmatics"},{"text":"Sociolinguistics"},{"text":"Discourse analysis"},{"text":"Language variation"},{"text":"Comparative linguistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Working-language proficiency"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally develop:"},{"type":"note","label":"Language A","text":"Native/near-native proficiency\nLanguage B: C1/C2-level professional proficiency"},{"type":"p","text":"Additional languages can significantly expand opportunities."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible combinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English + Hindi"},{"text":"English + Telugu"},{"text":"English + Tamil"},{"text":"English + Kannada"},{"text":"English + Malayalam"},{"text":"English + Bengali"},{"text":"English + Marathi"},{"text":"English + French"},{"text":"English + German"},{"text":"English + Spanish"},{"text":"English + Japanese"},{"text":"English + Korean"},{"text":"English + Arabic"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The specific combination should be selected based on market demand and the student's genuine language proficiency."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Translation skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Literal vs meaning-based translation"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Transcreation"},{"text":"Terminology management"},{"text":"Contextual translation"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Style-guide compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Translation technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Translation memories"},{"text":"Terminology databases"},{"text":"Machine translation"},{"text":"Translation quality estimation"},{"text":"Subtitle tools"},{"text":"Localization platforms"},{"text":"Corpus tools"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Speech-to-text"},{"text":"AI-assisted translation workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Domain expertise"},{"type":"p","text":"A translator with subject expertise is generally more valuable than a translator who only has general language skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible domains:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal"},{"text":"Medical"},{"text":"Financial"},{"text":"Technical"},{"text":"IT/software"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Media"},{"text":"Government"},{"text":"Tourism"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"International business"}]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Linguistic & Language Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic focus"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to Linguistics"},{"text":"Phonetics"},{"text":"Phonology"},{"text":"Morphology"},{"text":"Syntax"},{"text":"Semantics"},{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Language acquisition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Build language capability"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong writing in primary language"},{"text":"Strong reading comprehension in secondary language"},{"text":"Vocabulary development"},{"text":"Grammar accuracy"},{"text":"Listening comprehension"},{"text":"Speaking fluency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical work"},{"type":"p","text":"Start translating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short articles"},{"text":"News reports"},{"text":"Product descriptions"},{"text":"Educational content"},{"text":"Simple websites"},{"text":"Short stories"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a personal translation portfolio."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Translation & Applied Linguistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation theory"},{"text":"Comparative linguistics"},{"text":"Sociolinguistics"},{"text":"Pragmatics"},{"text":"Discourse analysis"},{"text":"Translation ethics"},{"text":"Terminology"},{"text":"Editing and proofreading"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn at least one professional translation/CAT workflow and become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Glossaries"},{"text":"Terminology databases"},{"text":"QA checks"},{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"Document formatting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce 8–15 strong samples across different content types."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"table","header":["Domain","Sample"],"rows":[[{"text":"General"},{"text":"Article translation"}],[{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Company profile"}],[{"text":"Technical"},{"text":"Product manual"}],[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Learning material"}],[{"text":"Media"},{"text":"News article"}],[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Advertisement localization"}],[{"text":"Government"},{"text":"Public information document"}],[{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Short story/poem translation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"This stage should move from academic translation to real-world translation workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Transcreation"},{"text":"Technical translation"},{"text":"Terminology management"},{"text":"Translation QA"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Professional invoicing"},{"text":"Translation briefs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop a specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one or two domains."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software localization","App localization","Website localization","AI language data"]},{"type":"p","text":"or:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + Law"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal translation","Contracts","Policies","Regulatory documents"]},{"type":"p","text":"or:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + Healthcare"},{"type":"flow","items":["Medical documents","Patient information","Healthcare content","Clinical documentation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong final project should demonstrate both linguistic knowledge and practical translation ability."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Bilingual Corpus & Translation Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a bilingual corpus and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Terminology"},{"text":"Sentence structures"},{"text":"Translation patterns"},{"text":"Cultural differences"},{"text":"Common translation errors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Domain Translation Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Translate a collection of documents from one specialist domain."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"English → Telugu Healthcare Translation Corpus"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source text"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Terminology glossary"},{"text":"Translation decisions"},{"text":"Quality review"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Localization Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a localized version of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Website"},{"text":"Mobile application"},{"text":"Educational platform"},{"text":"E-commerce store"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — AI-Assisted Translation Evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Translation vs Machine Translation vs AI-assisted Human Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Fluency"},{"text":"Terminology"},{"text":"Cultural appropriateness"},{"text":"Context preservation"},{"text":"Error types"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly relevant to the future translation industry."},{"type":"h","text":"Translation Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional translator should understand the complete workflow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Source Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Terminology Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation"},{"type":"h","text":"Editing"},{"type":"h","text":"Proofreading"},{"type":"h","text":"CAT/Translation-Memory QA"},{"type":"h","text":"Client/Subject Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Delivery"}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"During the second and third years, target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation agencies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation Intern"},{"text":"Junior Translator"},{"text":"Language Intern"},{"text":"Translation QA Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Localization companies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Localization Intern"},{"text":"Language Specialist Intern"},{"text":"Localization QA Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Media organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content Translation Intern"},{"text":"Subtitling Intern"},{"text":"Editorial Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Publishing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Translation Intern"},{"text":"Proofreading Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology companies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Localization Intern"},{"text":"Language Data Intern"},{"text":"NLP/Language Operations Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"NGOs and international organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Language Assistant"},{"text":"Translation Assistant"},{"text":"Communications Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA Linguistics graduate can target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Translator"},{"text":"Translator"},{"text":"Translation Assistant"},{"text":"Localization Associate"},{"text":"Localization Specialist"},{"text":"Language Specialist"},{"text":"Translation QA Associate"},{"text":"Proofreader"},{"text":"Editor"},{"text":"Subtitling Assistant"},{"text":"Content Localization Associate"},{"text":"Language Data Annotator"},{"text":"Terminology Assistant"},{"text":"Translation Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Multilingual Content Associate"},{"text":"Language Operations Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Literary Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Novels"},{"text":"Short stories"},{"text":"Poetry"},{"text":"Essays"},{"text":"Cultural publications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Requires strong literary sensitivity and writing ability."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Technical Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuals"},{"text":"Product documentation"},{"text":"Software documentation"},{"text":"Engineering documents"},{"text":"Technical specifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Linguistics + technical domain knowledge is valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Legal Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Agreements"},{"text":"Legal correspondence"},{"text":"Policies"},{"text":"Regulatory documents"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Requires strong legal terminology and exceptional accuracy."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Medical Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical documents"},{"text":"Healthcare content"},{"text":"Patient information"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical material"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Medical terminology and domain training are essential."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Localization Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Localizes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Apps"},{"text":"Games"},{"text":"Software"},{"text":"E-commerce platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest technology-oriented paths."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Subtitling & Media Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Films"},{"text":"Television"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Streaming content"},{"text":"Educational videos"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Skills include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Subtitle timing"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"text":"Condensation"},{"text":"Captioning"},{"text":"Audio-visual translation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. AI & Language Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"An increasingly important pathway."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Language data annotation"},{"text":"AI evaluation"},{"text":"LLM language evaluation"},{"text":"Machine translation evaluation"},{"text":"Multilingual NLP data"},{"text":"Prompt/response quality evaluation"},{"text":"Terminology datasets"},{"text":"Speech-language datasets"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A linguistics graduate can combine language expertise with Python, NLP and AI tools for this pathway."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Translation agencies"},{"text":"Translation + CAT tools + QA"}],[{"text":"Localization companies"},{"text":"Localization + CAT + terminology"}],[{"text":"Publishing houses"},{"text":"Translation + editing + literary writing"}],[{"text":"Media companies"},{"text":"Translation + subtitles + content"}],[{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Localization + language technology"}],[{"text":"IT companies"},{"text":"Technical translation + software knowledge"}],[{"text":"Legal firms"},{"text":"Legal terminology + accuracy"}],[{"text":"Healthcare companies"},{"text":"Medical terminology + translation"}],[{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Multilingual communication + development knowledge"}],[{"text":"Government organisations"},{"text":"Language proficiency + translation + administration"}],[{"text":"International organisations"},{"text":"Advanced languages + international affairs"}],[{"text":"Freelance market"},{"text":"Translation + specialization + client management"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional translation courses"},{"text":"CAT-tool training"},{"text":"Localization training"},{"text":"Subtitling/captioning training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Language"},{"type":"p","text":"Target internationally recognized proficiency where relevant:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CEFR-aligned assessments"},{"text":"DELF/DALF for French"},{"text":"Goethe-Zertifikat for German"},{"text":"DELE for Spanish"},{"text":"JLPT for Japanese"},{"text":"TOPIK for Korean"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact certification should match the target language and employer."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Translation-memory systems"},{"text":"Terminology management"},{"text":"Corpus tools"},{"text":"Localization platforms"},{"text":"Microsoft Office"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI/NLP"},{"type":"p","text":"Optional but valuable:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"NLP fundamentals"},{"text":"Machine translation"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"Prompt engineering"},{"text":"Language-data annotation"},{"text":"Corpus linguistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Pathways"},{"type":"h","text":"Path 1 — MA Linguistics"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Linguistics","MA Linguistics","Translation/Language Research"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linguistics research"},{"text":"Language technology"},{"text":"Academic careers"},{"text":"Computational linguistics"},{"text":"Language documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Path 2 — MA Translation Studies"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Linguistics","MA Translation/Translation Studies","Professional Translation"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most directly aligned academic routes."},{"type":"h","text":"Path 3 — MA Applied Linguistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Language teaching"},{"text":"Language assessment"},{"text":"Language research"},{"text":"International language work"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Path 4 — Domain Specialisation"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Linguistics","Domain PG/Certification","Specialist Translator"]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + Law"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Legal Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + Healthcare"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Medical Translator"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Localization/NLP"},{"type":"h","text":"Linguistics + International Relations"},{"type":"p","text":"→ International organisation language roles"},{"type":"h","text":"Government & International Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government translation departments"},{"text":"Public-sector language services"},{"text":"Courts and legal institutions"},{"text":"Parliamentary/administrative translation"},{"text":"State language departments"},{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"International organisations"},{"text":"Embassies and consulates"},{"text":"Multilateral organisations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, government translator positions have recruitment-specific eligibility, examinations and language requirements, so the exact current notification should always be checked before applying."},{"type":"h","text":"Freelance Translation Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Freelancing can become a significant career path."},{"type":"h","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional portfolio"},{"text":"Language specialization"},{"text":"Domain expertise"},{"text":"Translation samples"},{"text":"Client references"},{"text":"Terminology glossary"},{"text":"Professional profile"},{"text":"Quality-control process"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid positioning yourself simply as:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"I translate any language.\""},{"type":"p","text":"A stronger positioning is:"},{"type":"h","text":"English–Telugu Technical & Digital Content Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"or:"},{"type":"h","text":"English–Hindi Legal & Business Translator"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialisation improves differentiation."},{"type":"h","text":"AI and the Future of Translation"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly automate routine translation, but this does not eliminate the need for skilled language professionals."},{"type":"p","text":"The higher-value roles are likely to involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Post-editing"},{"text":"Translation quality evaluation"},{"text":"Cultural adaptation"},{"text":"Terminology management"},{"text":"Specialized translation"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"AI evaluation"},{"text":"Multilingual content strategy"},{"text":"Human-in-the-loop review"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended AI workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"AI/Machine Translation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human linguistic review","Terminology verification","Cultural/contextual review","QA","Final human approval"]},{"type":"p","text":"The translator should remain responsible for accuracy rather than blindly accepting machine output."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Technology Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"h","text":"Languages"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English"},{"text":"One strong Indian/foreign language"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Translation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAT tools"},{"text":"Translation memory"},{"text":"Terminology management"},{"text":"QA tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Productivity"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MS Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Workspace"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Proofreading"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Client communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corpus linguistics"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Machine translation"},{"text":"LLM evaluation"},{"text":"Localization platforms"},{"text":"Subtitle tools"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Speech technologies"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"BA"},{"text":"Linguistics Student"}],[{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Translation/Language Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Translator / Localization Associate"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Translator / Language Specialist"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Translator / Localization Specialist"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Translation Lead / Language Manager"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Translation Consultant / Localization Manager / Language Operations Lead"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative specialist route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Linguistics","Language Data/AI Intern","Language Data Analyst","NLP/Language Specialist","AI Language Evaluation Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Linguistics + language proficiency"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Translation + editing + CAT tools"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Specialisation + internships + portfolio"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"10–20 high-quality translation samples"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Junior Translator / Localization Associate"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Specialist Translator"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Senior Translator / Language Specialist"}],[{"text":"8+ Years"},{"text":"Lead / Manager / Consultant"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Specialist, independent consultant, language-tech professional or agency owner"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linguistics","C1/C2 Language Proficiency","Translation","Editing","Proofreading","Terminology","CAT Tools","Localization","Domain Expertise","Translation QA","AI-Assisted Translation","Cultural Competence"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For a BA Linguistics graduate, the strongest long-term strategy is not to remain a general translator. Build a strong second-language capability, add professional translation technology, then combine linguistics with a valuable domain such as technology, law, healthcare, finance, media or international business. For future resilience, adding localization, terminology management and AI/NLP evaluation can create opportunities beyond conventional translation and move the graduate toward higher-value language-technology roles."}]}]}